```catala
#[test]
declaration scope A:
  output w content integer

scope A:
  definition w equals
    let a equals 1 + 2 in
    ensure a = 3 then
    let b equals a + 3 in
    ensure b = 6 then
    ensure not (b > 6) then
    b
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope A
┌─[RESULT]─ A ─
│ w = 6
└─
```
